 every change (complete, reopen, rename, tag, untag) sets `updatedAt` to the time of the change, and a
 refused change leaves it alone. The domain never reads the clock: `createTodoList(now?)` takes a function
 that tells the time, the system clock by default, so tests can pass a fixed one.
